<section id="polkapop-prototype-faq-{{ section.id }}" class="polkapop-prototype-section">
  <div class="page">
    <section class="section" id="faq">
      <div class="container faq-wrap">
        <div><div class="kicker">FAQ</div><h2 class="section-title">Questions People Actually Ask</h2><p class="section-sub">Useful for users, Google, and AI search results. A rare triple win in the content swamp.</p></div>
        <div class="faq-list">
          <details open><summary><span>Is Polka Pop sugar-free?</span><span class="faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><p>Yes. The product messaging focuses on zero sugar, zero calories and zero sweeteners.</p></details>
          <details><summary><span>Can I use Polka Pop for mocktails?</span><span class="faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><p>Yes. It can be used as a refreshing base for mocktails, mixers and chilled drinks.</p></details>
          <details><summary><span>Where can I buy Polka Pop?</span><span class="faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><p>The homepage can include direct buying options and quick-commerce links like Swiggy Instamart, Zepto and Blinkit.</p></details>
          <details><summary><span>What bottle size is shown?</span><span class="faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><p>The product listing visual shows a 300ml bottle format.</p></details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
